      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LAPRAS (3) won again in quick time after racing on speed recording back to back wins at this track over 410m (23.45). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Great chance to get the job done again. CARLEY'S IMAGE (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 410m behind Ego Bale (23.99) in a Grade 5 H. Cannot be underestimated. ABRACADABRA (2) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (24.43) at Bendigo. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Can measure up this time. PAW REVY (5) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
